abstract: "Phygital Engram is a fast, private search for a second brain, or any folder of Markdown notes. Your agent finds the right note and the exact line, with the note, heading and date as the source. Read-only, local, no telemetry."
keywords: [search, markdown, notes, second-brain, sqlite, local-first]
